{"sourceUrl":"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/eb/0e/c25962a781070/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:36.329861+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/eb/0e/c25962a781070/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>复旦大学分子合成与识别科学中心成立于<span>2014</span>年<span>9</span>月，依托复旦大学化学系，自成立以来致力于引进并培养海内外顶尖人才和杰出青年人才。中心在国际优秀期刊上发表了多篇高水平论文，在有机合成方法学、不对称催化、天然产物全合成、化学生物学等领域取得了多项重要研究成果。</span></p><p><span>复旦大学化学系分子合成与识别科学中心各课题组拟招收<span>2027</span>年<span>9</span>月入学的直博生，参加此次招生计划的课题组包括：</span></p><p><span>中科院院士</span><span><a href=\"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/5b/c1/c26800a285633/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>麻生明</span></span></strong></a></span><span>教授团队（包括国家级人才计划入选者</span><span><a href=\"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/5b/c1/c26800a285633/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>钱辉</span></span></strong></a></span><span>教授、</span><span><a href=\"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/5b/fa/c26800a285690/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>喻浩</span></span></strong></a></span><span>副教授和</span><span><a href=\"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/44/e7/c26800a279783/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>杨成斌</span></span></strong></a></span><span>青年副研究员）</span></p><p><span>国家级人才计划入选者</span><span><a href=\"https://pinglugroup.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>陆平</span></span></strong></a></span><span>教授</span></p><p><span>国家级人才计划入选者</span><span><a href=\"https://chemistry.fudan.edu.cn/9f/fc/c21893a237564/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span>蔡泉</span></span></strong></a></span><span>教授</span></p><p><a href=\"https://rcmrs.fudan.edu.cn/eb/0e/c25962a781070/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>国家级人才计划入选者</span></a><span><a href=\"https://m.x-mol.com/groups/CanZhu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><spa